sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant Rafay as Rafay Controller (SaaS)
    participant Argo as ArgoCD (GitOps)
    participant CP as K8s Control Plane
    participant KAI as KAI Scheduler
    participant Cilium as Cilium CNI

    Admin->>Rafay: Create Project & Assign Quotas (e.g., 4 GPUs)
    Rafay->>Argo: Push vCluster Blueprint to Git Repo
    Argo->>CP: Deploy vCluster Pods & Namespaces
    CP-->>Argo: vCluster Ready
    Argo->>Cilium: Apply strict NetworkPolicies (Isolate Tenant)
    Argo->>KAI: Register Tenant GPU Quota & Storage Limits
    Rafay->>Admin: Provisioning Complete
    Admin->>Tenant: Distribute vCluster kubeconfig
    Note over Tenant, Cilium: Tenant is now completely isolated and quota-bound
